WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.208
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.125
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.458
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.583
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:10.375
This is

00:00:10.375 --> 00:00:11.625
The Champions

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:14.750
I'm one of the best players in the world...

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.208
according to my paycheck.

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:18.583
People say I would be good in the Premier League,

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.875
but first I need to be good in Serie A.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:23.958
Thanks, Kepa, but, ugh, we actually need a Champions League goalkeeper.

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:26.041
So, ugh, if you could just, ugh, go ahead and get off the set.

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:28.750
It was just a cramp. I'm staying. You can't make me go!

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:34.375
Zizou's back! Isco be alright.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.083
I can't sleep.

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.958
I haven't slept since that day. We were in total control.

00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:50.833
Then he took it away. My question is...

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.666
Who decided on the sizes of the paintings?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:59.833
I am an L.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.541
No, Antoine. You are not an L.

00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:06.541
You only need cojones in your heart.

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:07.166
Huh?

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:10.916
Come on, let's talk somewhere else that doesn't smell like a Porto-Potty.

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:14.958
Look, you're great, Antoine.

00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:18.125
Your hair deserves to be up there with the legends.

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.250
But do you?

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.000
Why not?! I'm just as good as Ronaldo and Messi!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.791
...At what?

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.208
I won the World Cup!

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:28.083
Mbappe won the World Cup. Now shut up and follow me.

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:32.916
Ah, the book no one reads.

00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:36.916
Whoa! Encroyable...

00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:40.416
OK, so apparently there's some kind of secret fight club

00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:41.625
going on in the basement.

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:46.958
Gentlemen, welcome to Fight-letico.

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:50.041
Yeah, so we never told Antoine about the secret fight club

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:53.791
because he's always got thousands of cameras following him.

00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:54.708
Oh wait, f--k.

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:56.916
The first rule of Fight-letico is:

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.583
You do not talk about Fight-letico...

00:01:59.583 --> 00:02:02.250
unless a streaming service offers you a lot of money.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:02.666
Uh huh.

00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:03.250
Got it.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:03.875
Like how much money?

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.541
The second rule of Fight-letico is:

00:02:06.541 --> 00:02:08.166
IF you do talk about Fight-letico

00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:10.208
because a streaming service offered you a lot of money,

00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:13.583
don't take tax advice from your family.

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:14.250
Smart.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:14.750
Totally.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.666
But like, seriously, like how much money?

00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:17.666
The third rule of Fight-letico:

00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:21.333
To get a red card for violent conduct is easy.

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.666
To get your opponent sent off for doing nothing—

00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:26.708
that is the work of a true assh--e.

00:02:26.708 --> 00:02:31.458
This is the real Madrid...Atletico style.

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:36.666
I know I'm not an Atletico player,

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:39.208
but they told me they had a safe space for violence.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.500
Uh, yes please.

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:45.250
Whoa.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:48.416
Haha, I know. It's f--king intense.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.875
Uh...ouch.

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:56.416
Finish him.

00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:02.833
I came back for this!

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:05.708
Alright. I'm ready now.

00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:09.208
You gotta play to the whistle, Antoine.

00:03:14.041 --> 00:03:16.875
Look at that red-card virgin.

00:03:18.875 --> 00:03:20.750
Hey, what's going on, tough guys?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.166
Grabbing your cojones?

00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:24.750
This is you. This is what you look like.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.875
And this is what you look like.

00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:28.750
I knocked you out of the Champions League,

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.750
and I can knock you out right here.

00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:33.041
OK, I didn't touch him.

00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:35.916
Stop shaking your heads disapprovingly. People love me.

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:36.791
You all love me, right?

00:03:39.416 --> 00:03:40.583
Not cool, man.

00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:42.583
But without love I am just a shell.

00:03:42.583 --> 00:03:44.875
A really, really good-looking, talented shell!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.083
Wow. You are...shameless.

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:53.375
I am legend.

00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:56.500
And legends need trophies!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.875
Okay, bye!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:33.916
Good fight, man.

00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:34.708
Good fight.

00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:35.500
(whispering)

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.750
Wait. What did you say about mi madre?!

